           when options = '["Because the fault has no displacement, so the surfaces are continuous across it.", "Because the extrapolation limit of 800 m is wider than the fault''s damage zone.", "Because the mask tests distance to control points and knows nothing about faults.", "Because both blocks contain three wells each, so both sides are equally controlled."]'::jsonb then 'old'
           when options = '["Because the fault has no displacement, so the surfaces and the mask are continuous across its trace.", "Because the extrapolation limit of 800 m is wider than the fault''s damage zone, so the mask bridges it.", "Because the mask tests distance to control points and knows nothing about faults.", "Because both blocks contain three wells each, so both sides are equally controlled."]'::jsonb then 'new'
